msgid ""
"`build_xacro_mappings()` always sets `ros2_control_hardware_type` to the "
"launch `hardware` string. When `hardware:=gz` it also sets `gazebo` to "
"`true`. Profile YAML `hardware:` (serial, `arm_ctrl_mode`, …) is injected"
