"`/{controller}/target_joint_position` (`std_msgs/Float64MultiArray`). "
"FSM: `/fsm_command` (`std_msgs/Int32`). Action / Service types and WBC "
"body/head topics: [FSM and Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md)."
